      "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/1904.06690",
      "contributions": [
        "Introduces bidirectional masked-item modeling for sequential recommendation.",
        "Section 3.6 describes last-item-only training examples to align with appended-mask recommendation."
      ],
      "limitations": [
        "Does not specify a numerical terminal-example mixture ratio or uniform random-prefix rule.",
        "Does not establish the optimal mixture for this benchmark; terminal supervision is an established component rather than an original principle here."
      ]
    },
